#: main.cpp:52
msgid ""
"The reliable KDE session manager that talks the standard X11R6 \n"
"session management protocol (XSMP)."
msgstr ""
"Мудири боэътимоди сеансҳои KDE, ки қарордоди идораи сеансҳои \n"
"муқаррарии X11R6-ро истифода мебарад (XSMP)."

#: main.cpp:240
msgid "The KDE Session Manager"
msgstr "Мудири Сеансҳои KDE"

#: main.cpp:242
msgid "(C) 2000, The KDE Developers"
msgstr "(C) 2000, The KDE Developers"

#: main.cpp:243
msgid "Matthias Ettrich"
msgstr "Matthias Ettrich"

#: main.cpp:244
msgid "Luboš Luňák"
msgstr "Luboš Luňák"

#: main.cpp:244
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Тайёркунанда"

#: main.cpp:252
msgid "Restores the saved user session if available"
msgstr "Барқароркунии сеансҳои корванди захирашуда, агар имконпазир бошад"

#: main.cpp:254
msgid ""
"Starts 'wm' in case no other window manager is \n"
"participating in the session. Default is 'kwin'"
msgstr ""
"Дар ҳолате, ки дигар мудири тирезавӣ истифода намешавад 'wm'-ро \n"
"оғоз кунед. Бо нобаёнӣ ин - 'kwin'"

#: main.cpp:255
msgid "Also allow remote connections"
msgstr "Пайвастшавии дурдаст иҷоза диҳед"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Victor Ibragimov"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "victor.ibragimov@gmail.com"

